{
  "Name": "Nagios XI 5.5.6 to 5.7.5 - ConfigWizards Authenticated Remote Code Exection",
  "Description": "This module exploits CVE-2021-25296, CVE-2021-25297, and CVE-2021-25298, which are OS command injection vulnerabilities in the windowswmi, switch, and cloud-vm configuration wizards that allow an authenticated user to perform remote code execution on Nagios XI versions 5.5.6 to 5.7.5 as the apache user. Valid credentials for a Nagios XI user are required. This module has been successfully tested against official NagiosXI OVAs from 5.5.6-5.7.5.",
